+In the saved single-run comparison, all six learning models had lower CSI than Persistence under fixed Q95, Q97.5, 0.5 and 1.0~mm\,h$^{-1}$ decision rules. Better AUC and improvements obtained with validation-selected cutoffs do not remove this limitation, particularly given the associated high false-alarm ratios.
